@startuml
[*] --> Idle
Idle --> AddRecipe : Add Recipe
AddRecipe --> [*] : Recipe Added
Idle --> ViewRecipe : View Recipe
ViewRecipe --> [*] : Return
ViewRecipe --> ShareRecipe : Share Recipe
ShareRecipe --> [*] : Sharing Complete
Idle --> SearchRecipe : Search Recipe
SearchRecipe --> [*] : Return
SearchRecipe --> ViewRecipe : Select Recipe
@enduml
